Recovery operation
------------------
Before integration, `git stash push --include-untracked` saved a recovery
snapshot as stash@{0}. An external workspace archive was retained at
`/home/user/ClienteRecriado_cycle17_workspace_before_fastforward.tar.gz`
(SHA-256 `cbbe233b47f79c97f1d5a94241e6623f1f1da214304c6f20e88b4bb9e135bc1e`).
The fixed session branch was then fast-forwarded from
972fabcea1b0d4e80345f0f5abd287b46d819455 to the published 519 commit
4c36befab01263bf95a509d1c8306c56a1e876c5. No destructive Git reset/clean,
branch switch, force-push, or write to the reference repository was used.
The changes were overlaid after reviewing the local-vs-published differences;
the six PPM variants were not added to Git.

